      "description": {
        "type": "/type/text",
        "value": "The authors minutely document the legislative history of how lobbyist from the tobacco industry and corroborating scientist persisted in obfuscating the harmful effects of smoking by simply purporting that the traditional science on the matter was flawed and overwrought. This strategy became a blueprint for other industries that were being scrutinized for their negative consumer health or environmental impact."
